    "memory": [
        {
            "id": "0",
            "text": "Birdman的故事以似乎发生在现实时间的方式讲述，只有短暂的过去闪回，以创造一种紧迫感和强度。",
            "event": "NONE"
        },
        {
            "id": "1",
            "text": "Big Little Lies使用闪回来探索塑造角色的创伤事件，以创建更深层次的情感连接。",
            "event": "NONE"
        },
        {
            "id": "2",
            "text": "Scarves, hats, and belts for accessories",
            "event": "NONE"
        },
        {
            "id": "3",
            "text": "Planning ahead for transportation from Heathrow Airport",
            "event": "NONE"
        },
        {
            "id": "4",
            "text": "Westworld的使用闪回和时间线来创造一种困惑和神秘感，使观众更加投入。",
            "event": "NONE"
        },
        {
            "id": "5",
            "text": "Amazon Cockatoo, our proposed reading comprehension app for children, has a bright future ahead. Our focus will be on continuously improving and expanding the app's features, as well as reaching a wider audience of parents and educators. Moving forward, we plan to collaborate with schools and literacy organizations to integrate our app into their reading curricula. We will also be gathering feedback from parents, educators, and children to improve the app's functionality and usability. Additionally, we will be continuously monitoring and updating our security measures to ensure that the sensitive data we collect remains secure. Our long-term goal is to become the leading reading comprehension app for children, providing a valuable resource for parents and educators to help children succeed in reading. With our dedication to evidence-based strategies, engaging user experience, and strong security measures, we are confident that Amazon Cockatoo will continue to make a positive impact on children's reading comprehension for years to come.",
            "event": "ADD"
        }
    ]
}

